# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to transpile a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") to a standard [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). It continues with the same time evolution example from the [fermionic circuits guide](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"
msgstr "Tento návod vysvětluje, jak transpilovat [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") na standardní [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). Pokračuje se stejným příkladem časového vývoje z [návodu k fermionovým obvodům](circuit#fermionic-circuit-explanation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation stages {#transpilation-stages}"
msgstr "Fáze transpilace {#transpilation-stages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As explained in [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), the preset pass managers in this project split the transpilation into the following stages:\n"
msgstr "Jak je vysvětleno v [`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\"), přednastavené správce průchodů v tomto projektu dělí transpilaci do následujících fází:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Input** {#input}"
msgstr "**Vstup** {#input}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the input circuit to a directed acyclic graph (DAG) data structure.\n"
msgstr "Převádí vstupní obvod na datovou strukturu orientovaného acyklického grafu (DAG).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Optimization** {#optimization}"
msgstr "**Optimalizace** {#optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keeps the circuit in fermionic space. These passes use fermionic structure and commutation relations while problem-aware knowledge remains fully available. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") is the pass that Trotterizes an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate here, with a product formula or with [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), and [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") its occupation-aware variant; see [Optimization Passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) for the full set and [Synthesize an Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation) for how a product formula is chosen.\n"
msgstr "Ponechává obvod ve fermionovém prostoru. Tyto průchody využívají fermionovou strukturu a komutační relace, zatímco znalost specifická pro daný problém zůstává plně k dispozici. [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") je průchod, který zde trotterizuje hradlo [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\"), a to součinovým vzorcem nebo pomocí [`FermionicQDrift`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-q-drift#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicQDrift\"), a [`QDriftTrotterization`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-q-drift-trotterization#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.QDriftTrotterization\") je jeho varianta s ohledem na obsazení; úplnou sadu najdeš v [Optimalizačních průchodech](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes#qiskit-fermions-transpiler-passes-optimization) a to, jak se součinový vzorec volí, v [Syntéza hradla Evolution ve fermionovém prostoru](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-explanation).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Layout** {#layout}"
msgstr "**Rozvržení** {#layout}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maps fermionic mode registers to quantum registers. For occupation-basis mappings like Jordan-Wigner, each fermionic mode maps to a single qubit. This stage also supports more general mappings where the number of qubits differs from the number of fermionic modes.\n"
msgstr "Mapuje fermionové registry módů na kvantové registry. U mapování v bázi obsazení, jako je Jordan-Wigner, se každý fermionový mód mapuje na jediný qubit. Tato fáze podporuje i obecnější mapování, kde se počet qubitů liší od počtu fermionových módů.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Synthesis** {#synthesis}"
msgstr "**Syntéza** {#synthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts fermionic gates to qubit operations by using the chosen fermion-to-qubit mapping. [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") instances are transformed into sequences of standard quantum gates. A barrier is carried through onto every qubit of each register it touched, so it continues to separate the gates on either side of it during the qubit stage.\n"
msgstr "Převádí fermionová hradla na qubitové operace pomocí zvoleného mapování fermionů na qubity. Instance [`FermionicGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-gate#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicGate\") se transformují na posloupnosti standardních kvantových hradel. Bariéra se přenáší na každý qubit každého registru, kterého se dotýkala, takže během qubitové fáze nadále odděluje hradla na obou svých stranách.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Qubit** {#qubit}"
msgstr "**Qubit** {#qubit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiles the resulting qubit circuit by using standard Qiskit methods, including optimization, layout, and routing for your target hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpiluje výsledný qubitový obvod standardními metodami Qiskit, včetně optimalizace, rozvržení a směrování pro tvůj cílový hardware.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Output** {#output}"
msgstr "**Výstup** {#output}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Converts the internal DAG data structure to the desired output format.\n"
msgstr "Převádí interní datovou strukturu DAG na požadovaný výstupní formát.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A practical example: transpilation using Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"
msgstr "Praktický příklad: transpilace pomocí Jordan-Wigner {#a-practical-example-transpilation-using-jordan-wigner}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the preset pass manager to transpile your fermionic circuit with the Jordan-Wigner fermion-to-qubit mapping:\n"
msgstr "Použij přednastavený správce průchodů k transpilaci fermionového obvodu s mapováním fermionů na qubity Jordan-Wigner:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs group=\"tab\">\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit import FermionicCircuit\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.circuit.library import Evolution\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.operators import FermionOperator, cre, ann\n"
"    >>> from qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets import generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Create the same fermionic circuit from the previous guide\n"
"    >>> circuit = FermionicCircuit(4)\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian = FermionOperator.from_terms([\n"
"    ...     ([cre(0), ann(2)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(2), ann(0)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(1), ann(3)], 0.5),\n"
"    ...     ([cre(3), ann(1)], 0.5),\n"
"    ... ])\n"
"    >>> hamiltonian.groups = [0, 0, 1, 1]\n"
"    >>> evolution = Evolution(4, hamiltonian, time=1.0)\n"
"    >>> circuit.append(evolution, circuit.register)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Generate the Jordan-Wigner transpilation pipeline\n"
"    >>> pm = generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # Transpile the fermionic circuit to a qubit circuit\n"
"    >>> qubit_circuit = pm.run(circuit)\n"
"    >>>\n"
"    >>> # The result is a standard QuantumCircuit\n"
"    >>> print(type(qubit_circuit))\n"
"    <class 'qiskit.circuit.quantumcircuit.QuantumCircuit'>\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""

